{"id":"633873","name":"煎饼果子","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/633873/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"油条","amount":"1根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2枚"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"小米面","amount":"20g"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小苏打","amount":"1–2g"},{"name":"蒜蓉辣酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉、小米面、小苏打、盐加水混合静置30分钟（夏天天热的话送冰箱）。","img":"images/633873/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅热倒油（少一些，最好用油刷刷）。","img":"images/633873/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入适量面糊。","img":"images/633873/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用刮刀刮。","img":"images/633873/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"尽量刮薄刮匀。","img":"images/633873/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面糊变干加一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/633873/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用刮刀刮匀。","img":"images/633873/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒黑芝麻。","img":"images/633873/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻面加蒜蓉辣酱（就是老牌子，小时候吃的天津蒜蓉辣酱）。","img":"images/633873/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"刷匀。","img":"images/633873/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒葱花。","img":"images/633873/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"半根油条。","img":"images/633873/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"从一边卷起。","img":"images/633873/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"尽量卷紧实。","img":"images/633873/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"一起吃煎饼果子吧！","img":"images/633873/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}